login.h4_f:
nakon uspjeha: 201 + JWT omotnica (isti oblik kao registar)
na 2FA potrebno: 200 { "needs_2fa": true } (još nema JWT)
pri neuspjehu: 401 { "greška":"invalid_credentials" }

apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Zaglavlja: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: upozorenje, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Tijelo: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, podaci: <sealed>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Polog: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Preuzimanje: GET /bmp/messages (auth'd)

controller.h1_f:
GET /v1/integrity → {status, signed_by, matched, mismatched, …}
GET /v1/health → {status, verzija, pubkey, statistika}
GET /v1/entries → [{protocol, url}, …]
GET /v1/mirrors → [controller_url, …]

fcm.h1_f:
POST https://fcm.googleapis.com/v1/projects/<project>/messages:send
Autorizacija: nositelj <oauth2_token>
Tijelo: {message: {token: <device>, data: {...sealed...}, android: {collapse_key}}}

federation.h1_f:
omotnica = {source_node, target_user, inner_ct, inner_nonce, sent_at}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(source_priv, CBOR(omotnica))
POST /federation/deliver {omotnica, znak}
B provjerava: sig protiv federacija[source_node].pubkey

fts5.h1_f:
CREATE VIRTUAL TABLE messages_fts USING fts5(
  sadržaj, -- tokenizirani stupac
  room_id UNINDEXED,
  tokenize = 'unicode61 remove_diacritics 2'
);
upit: SELECT rowid FROM messages_fts WHERE content MATCH 'foo'

gravitix.h1_f:
on /start { emit "Dobro došli, {ctx.first_name}" }
on /add <item> {
  state.list = (state.list ili []) + [ctx.args.item]
  emitiraj "Dodano: {ctx.args.item}"
}

prekey.h1_f:
paket = {
  identity_pk,
  signed_prekey_pk,
  signed_prekey_sig = Ed25519-Sign(identity_priv, signed_prekey_pk),
  jednokratni_preključevi: [pk_0, pk_1, ..., pk_9]
}

vapid.h1_f:
VAPID ključevi: Ed25519 par ključeva po čvoru
znak JWT: {aud: push_service_origin, exp: sada + 12h, sub: mailto:ops@example}
zaglavlja push zahtjeva: Autorizacija: vapid t=<jwt>, k=<vapid_public_key>
